{"id":"b7e69cae674ee491","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/03_first_order_logic.md","title":"一阶语法、替换、证明与固定模型满足","display":"一阶语法、替换、证明与固定模型满足","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","specification"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>specification</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"1.-语法与签名\">1. 语法与签名</h2>\n<p>签名分量 F、R 是任意固定集合；f:F→ω 与 r:R→ω 为元数图。标签把函数符号和关系符号的位置区分，所以即使 F、R 作为集合相交也不歧义。项和公式用有限节点生成；FFun/FRel 的实参是函数图编码的有限列，长度恰好等于签名元数，允许零元。</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>缩写</th>\n<th>集合参数（按位置）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"50085369706c1ec8\" href=\"?note=50085369706c1ec8\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_FSig\">FSig</a></td>\n<td><code>E, F, R, f, r</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"21487f65c94a2183\" href=\"?note=21487f65c94a2183\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_FTerm\">FTerm</a></td>\n<td><code>F, f, t</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7d109a270c3f3d46\" href=\"?note=7d109a270c3f3d46\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_FFm\">FFm</a></td>\n<td><code>E, F, R, f, r, t</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d2980fe49e8b1fcc\" href=\"?note=d2980fe49e8b1fcc\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_FTFree\">FTFree</a></td>\n<td><code>F, f, x, t</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"be21a8fefe07593d\" href=\"?note=be21a8fefe07593d\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_FFree\">FFree</a></td>\n<td><code>E, F, R, f, r, x, t</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"7bc2915a65f677d3\" href=\"?note=7bc2915a65f677d3\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_FUses\">FUses</a></td>\n<td><code>E, F, R, f, r, x, t</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"53c6f94a73ab3e2c\" href=\"?note=53c6f94a73ab3e2c\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_FSentence\">FSentence</a></td>\n<td><code>E, F, R, f, r, a</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"edf20b356f2815c5\" href=\"?note=edf20b356f2815c5\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_FTSub\">FTSub</a></td>\n<td><code>F, f, x, s, t, u</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"46807fb048a05651\" href=\"?note=46807fb048a05651\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_FSafeSub\">FSafeSub</a></td>\n<td><code>E, F, R, f, r, x, s, t, u</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"0a585a933cab3c7c\" href=\"?note=0a585a933cab3c7c\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_FEncodeTerm\">FEncodeTerm</a></td>\n<td><code>F, f, g, t, u</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"5caa540e2aeaaba6\" href=\"?note=5caa540e2aeaaba6\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_FEncodeFormula\">FEncodeFormula</a></td>\n<td><code>E, F, R, f, r, g, t, u</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"394f65c7afb19850\" href=\"?note=394f65c7afb19850\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_FAlpha\">FAlpha</a></td>\n<td><code>E, F, R, f, r, a, b</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"6333585a11e77692\" href=\"?note=6333585a11e77692\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_FSubAlpha\">FSubAlpha</a></td>\n<td><code>E, F, R, f, r, x, s, a, b</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>FFree 在全称绑定同名变量处停止；FUses 连绑定名也计入。命名公式的 α 等价由两个变量栈编码的相等定义：最近命中是绑定指标，未命中是栈长加自由名字。全称节点只保留无名绑定构造子，不能把自由名相同与绑定指标相同混淆。</p>\n<p>FSafeSub 是 free-for 部分替换：若目标变量不自由出现，输出原式；否则穿过量词时要求绑定名不在插入项自由名内。FSubAlpha 允许先作 α 改名再用 FSafeSub，因而其结果不是字面唯一，而是模 α 唯一。有限输入可先统一改用避开所有相关名字的新名，再按构造子进行替换；当前可执行参考只直接实现 free-for 版本与 α 编码。</p>\n<h2 id=\"2.-证明\">2. 证明</h2>\n<p>FAx 明列 C1、C2、C3、全称实例化、全称对蕴含分配、真空量化模式。等号开启时再加自反与带合法替换见证的 Leibniz 模式；等号关闭时没有等号语法。推理为 MP、受依赖自由变量限制的推广、α 改名。完整规则见对应规范页而非“采用标准规则”的外部引用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"3.-语义\">3. 语义</h2>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>缩写</th>\n<th>集合参数（按位置）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"debeca760396db21\" href=\"?note=debeca760396db21\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_FModel\">FModel</a></td>\n<td><code>E, F, R, f, r, D, I, J</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"879692e175100c7e\" href=\"?note=879692e175100c7e\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_FTuples\">FTuples</a></td>\n<td><code>D, n, T</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"b1aebb86096a232a\" href=\"?note=b1aebb86096a232a\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_FAssign\">FAssign</a></td>\n<td><code>D, e</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-17\" data-note=\"e8b9ce000bccc858\" href=\"?note=e8b9ce000bccc858\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_FTEval\">FTEval</a></td>\n<td><code>F, f, D, I, e, t, v</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-18\" data-note=\"9398adaa58c37efb\" href=\"?note=9398adaa58c37efb\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_FTable\">FTable</a></td>\n<td><code>E, F, R, f, r, D, I, J, S</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-19\" data-note=\"c284b26e0e1daa9f\" href=\"?note=c284b26e0e1daa9f\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_FSat\">FSat</a></td>\n<td><code>E, F, R, f, r, D, I, J, e, a</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-20\" data-note=\"4ab9e67d837fd090\" href=\"?note=4ab9e67d837fd090\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_FConseq\">FConseq</a></td>\n<td><code>E, F, R, f, r, g, a</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>每个模型有非空集合载体 D、函数解释 I 与关系解释 J。函数 c 的图定义域恰为 D 的 arity(c) 次有限序列集；关系解释为该序列集的子集。对象等号由解释值真的相等解释。</p>\n<p>固定模型后，满足表在“公式集合 × D^ω”中取子集，逐构造子给出充要条件。全称量词改变一个变量的赋值；新赋值仍是 ω→D 的图。项求值是独立有限推导关系，不调用语义真值预言机。跨模型后承直接使用 ∀D∀I∀J∀e 的一阶公式，绝不形成所有模型的集合。</p>\n<p>模型非空是本版本条件；不附加有限模型条件。公式形成与候选推导核验在有效签名和有限数据上可执行；后承和可证性不存在这里承诺的无条件总判定算法。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-语法与签名","text":"1. 语法与签名","level":2},{"id":"2.-证明","text":"2. 证明","level":2},{"id":"3.-语义","text":"3. 语义","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_FSig","status":"resolved","id":"50085369706c1ec8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"1. 语法与签名","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_FSig|FSig]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_FTerm","status":"resolved","id":"21487f65c94a2183","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"1. 语法与签名","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_FTerm|FTerm]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_FFm","status":"resolved","id":"7d109a270c3f3d46","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"1. 语法与签名","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_FFm|FFm]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_FTFree","status":"resolved","id":"d2980fe49e8b1fcc","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"1. 语法与签名","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_FTFree|FTFree]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_FFree","status":"resolved","id":"be21a8fefe07593d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"1. 语法与签名","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_FFree|FFree]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_FUses","status":"resolved","id":"7bc2915a65f677d3","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"1. 语法与签名","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_FUses|FUses]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_FSentence","status":"resolved","id":"53c6f94a73ab3e2c","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"1. 语法与签名","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_FSentence|FSentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_FTSub","status":"resolved","id":"edf20b356f2815c5","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"1. 语法与签名","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_FTSub|FTSub]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_FSafeSub","status":"resolved","id":"46807fb048a05651","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"1. 语法与签名","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_FSafeSub|FSafeSub]]","embed":f