范公式/ZFC_FSat","status":"resolved","id":"c284b26e0e1daa9f","anchor":"ref-19","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"3. 语义","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_FSat|FSat]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_FConseq","status":"resolved","id":"4ab9e67d837fd090","anchor":"ref-20","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"3. 语义","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_FConseq|FConseq]]","embed":false}],"math":[],"bytes":3865,"backlinks":[{"id":"2a802213915eee42","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[03_first_order_logic]]"},{"id":"45ddb0364081e108","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"各参数的意义、构造子及局部条款见 [[000_ZFC/03_first_order_logic]]。纯语言约定见 [[000_ZFC/01_language]]，有限证明列的读法见 [[000_ZFC/02_proofs]]。"},{"id":"94480915a7ee730a","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"各参数的意义、构造子及局部条款见 [[000_ZFC/03_first_order_logic]]。纯语言约定见 [[000_ZFC/01_language]]，有限证明列的读法见 [[000_ZFC/02_proofs]]。"}],"outgoing":["50085369706c1ec8","21487f65c94a2183","7d109a270c3f3d46","d2980fe49e8b1fcc","be21a8fefe07593d","7bc2915a65f677d3","53c6f94a73ab3e2c","edf20b356f2815c5","46807fb048a05651","0a585a933cab3c7c","5caa540e2aeaaba6","394f65c7afb19850","6333585a11e77692","debeca760396db21","879692e175100c7e","b1aebb86096a232a","e8b9ce000bccc858","9398adaa58c37efb","c284b26e0e1daa9f","4ab9e67d837fd090"]}